---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="School Development Programs" description="Sarvagun Society's school development initiatives — computers, desks, water tanks, sports kits, and competitions in government schools.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">School Development Programs</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-muted space-y-4">
        <p>Sarvagun Society has been doing various activities in government schools of Dehradun.</p>

        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-text">Computer Donation</h3>
        <p>The society donated <strong>2 desktop computers</strong> to the Government Junior Primary School in village Bhitarli, Dehradun to ensure students get good computer education.</p>

        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-text">Furniture &amp; Seating</h3>
        <p>Society members found that in many schools, no proper seating arrangements and toilets were available, causing difficulties for students. The society arranged for proper seating and donated pairs of desks and benches.</p>

        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-text">Water Supply</h3>
        <p>The society installed water tanks in schools so that students and teachers can have clean drinking water.</p>

        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-text">Sports &amp; Competitions</h3>
        <p>The society regularly donates games kits. On national occasions, theme-based patriotic recitation and painting competitions are organized for students of classes 6th to 8th, with prizes awarded to winners.</p>

        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-text">Early Initiative</h3>
        <p>On 16/09/2010, the society organized a charity program at the primary school of village Malsi, donating sitting mattresses, tables, teaching charts, a globe, and other study materials.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
